falling rain are mirrored beneath the surface. Atop a dark, muscular water buffalo standing waist-deep in the water sits a small child, barefoot and dressed in simple, earth-toned traditional garments — perhaps a pale pink or ochre tunic and loose trousers — their posture relaxed, gazing ahead as if lost in contemplation. The child’s skin appears smooth and dew-kissed, subtly highlighted by the diffused daylight filtering through the clouds above.\n\nThe background is layered with dense forests of tall, slender conifers and broadleaf trees, their leaves glistening with moisture, creating rich textural contrast against the softer mists. A single red circular seal stamp bearing white Chinese characters (“二十四节气” — Twenty-Four Solar Terms) floats near the center-right, adding a touch of cultural authenticity and visual warmth to the cool-toned composition. Dominating the upper third of the image are two large, bold calligraphic characters — “清明” (Qingming) — painted in flowing white brushstrokes with subtle ink bleed effects, giving them an organic, hand-painted feel. Below, smaller text reads “[清明·时节]” and “清明时节情谊浓，踏青祭祖念先人,” followed by the English translation “PURE BRIGHTNESS” in clean, minimalist sans-serif font.\n\nThe lighting is soft and directional, coming from behind the mountain peaks, casting long, gentle shadows across the valley floor while illuminating the mist with a heavenly radiance. The overall mood is one of peaceful reverence, quiet nostalgia, and natural harmony — a moment suspended between memory and presence, where nature and tradition intertwine under the whispering rain. Every element — from the texture of the buffalo’s wet hide to the ripples distorting the reflection — is rendered with meticulous attention to detail, inviting the viewer into a world both dreamlike and deeply real."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 136, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 103, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 24, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 19}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [132], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["blurry ugly bad"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 126, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [307.8125, 88], "pos": [1421.465087890625, 951.6904907226562], "id": 98, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [373.4569091796875, 522.9699096679688], "pos": [2317.802490234375, 432.77850341796875], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 134, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 104, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "widget_ue_connectable": {"filename_prefix": true}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 26}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [110], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [419.7969970703125, 849.4487915039062], "pos": [-156.81954956054688, 580.3522338867188], "widgets_values": ["你是一个专业的海报设计提示词扩写专家。当用户输入简单的海报描述时，主文艺术字设计，你需要将其扩写成详细、专业、完整的图像生成提示词。\n扩写原则\n保持核心意图：所有扩写内容必须与用户原始描述紧密相关，不得偏离主题\n逻辑层次清晰：按照\"整体风格→主体元素→背景环境→文字设计→光影效果→氛围情绪\"的顺序展开\n细节丰富具体：添加颜色、材质、光影、构图、质感等可视化细节\n无空行格式：生成的提示词必须连续成段，段落之间不要有空行\n扩写结构框架\n第一段-整体风格与构图：定义海报类型（促销/节日/产品/文化等）、视觉风格（3D/扁平/写实/插画等）、色彩基调（主色+辅色+强调色）、构图方式（中心/对角/三分法等）\n第二段-主体元素描述：详细描述核心视觉主体（人物/产品/吉祥物/场景等），包括形态、质感、颜色、位置、动作姿态、细节特征\n第三段-背景与环境：描述背景层次、空间深度、装饰元素、抽象图形、氛围道具，营造场景感\n第四段-文字信息设计：说明标题文字的内容、字体风格、颜色、位置、大小比例、特效处理（渐变/描边/立体等）\n第五段-光影与渲染效果：描述光源类型、光照方向、阴影处理、特殊效果（光晕/粒子/镜头光斑/体积光等）、材质表现\n第六段-整体氛围总结：概括情绪基调（活力/宁静/奢华/温馨等）、视觉冲击力、目标感受\n关键细节要素库\n色彩描述：电光紫、洋红、青色、翡翠绿、深酒红、琥珀色、渐变、饱和度高、冷暖对比\n材质质感：光泽、磨砂、金属、半透明、丝绒、水晶、液态、磨砂玻璃、拉丝\n光影效果：体积光、环境光、定向光、柔光、硬光、光晕、镜头光斑、星芒、反射、漫射\n构图术语：中心构图、对角线、三分法、对称、留白、层次感、景深、透视\n风格关键词：3D立体、波普艺术、极简主义、赛博朋克、中国风、写实、插画风、扁平化\n氛围情绪：活力四射、宁静致远、奢华高端、温馨治愈、神秘梦幻、热烈欢庆\n输出要求\n生成的提示词必须是英文（图像生成工具通用语言）\n总长度控制在800-1500词之间\n段落之间用换行连接，不要有空行\n使用具体可视觉化的描述，避免抽象概念\n保持语句流畅，适合直接用于图像生成\n示例转换逻辑\n用户输入：\"双12促销海报，天猫黑猫，热闹\"\n你需扩写包含：节日主题定位、黑猫形象细节、舞台场景、色彩方案、文字排版、促销信息区域、光影特效、整体氛围等完整元素\n现在请根据用户的简单描述，生成专业详细的海报提示词。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 82, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "parameters", "links": [49], "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}], "size": [210, 346], "pos": [-568.478271484375, 517.4541015625], "widgets_values": [1024, 30, 0.9, 0.05, 1, 0.8, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0.1, 5, -1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", "label": "top_k", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "top_k"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_p"}, "name": "top_p", "label": "top_p", "type": "FLOAT", "loc