panels that appear to be crafted from translucent jade or liquid crystal, shifting between emerald green and deep teal under the light. Embedded within the fairing and wheel rims are subtle, glowing golden patterns inspired by ancient cloud motifs and dragon scales, creating a \"Guochao\" (New Chinese Style) aesthetic. The bike is positioned in a dynamic pose, leaning slightly as if caught in mid-motion, with raindrops interacting realistically with its glossy surfaces, some bouncing off and others clinging to the chrome. The tires are wide and textured with futuristic tread patterns, and the exhaust system is replaced by a sleek, glowing energy core that emits a soft blue-green aura, symbolizing its electric power source. The rider, if present, is stylized as a futuristic guardian wearing armor that fuses leather textures with holographic silk fabrics, adorned with embroidered cloud patterns that glow when wet.\n\nThe background environment is a layered, atmospheric scene representing the \"Grain Rain\" period, combining a misty, lush Chinese landscape with a neon-lit futuristic cityscape. In the mid-ground, towering traditional pavilions and pagodas are reimagined with glass and steel structures, their roofs covered in mossy green tiles that shimmer with moisture. Lush bamboo forests and blooming magnolia trees rise from the ground, their leaves glistening with raindrops. Behind these elements, a hazy horizon features futuristic skyscrapers with vertical light strips in cyan and magenta, partially obscured by volumetric rain clouds. Abstract geometric shapes, such as floating hexagons and flowing water ribbons, are scattered throughout the scene in varying opacities, adding to the maximalist complexity without cluttering the main subject. Decorative elements include falling rain streaks rendered as glowing trails, stylized lightning bolts in soft white, and floating particles of pollen or spores that catch the light, enhancing the sense of a living, breathing ecosystem.\n\nThe typography design features the title in large, bold, all-Chinese characters that serve as the primary visual anchor. The font style is a custom blend of strong, blocky calligraphy strokes with sharp, angular cuts, reminiscent of brush strokes but refined with a digital, almost metallic edge. The text is rendered in a gradient of deep emerald green to bright cyan, with a thick, glossy 3D bevel effect and a subtle gold inner glow to make it pop against the busy background. The characters are arranged in a staggered, overlapping layout that follows the diagonal flow of the composition, creating a sense of rhythm and movement. Secondary text elements, such as the date \"Grain Rain\" or promotional details, are placed in smaller, cleaner sans-serif fonts with a semi-transparent white fill and a thin black outline, positioned in the negative spaces to ensure readability without competing with the main title. The text itself appears to have a slight water-refraction texture, as if it is part of the rainy atmosphere.\n\nLighting and rendering effects are crucial to bringing this complex scene to life. The primary light source is a combination of natural diffused daylight filtering through the rain clouds and artificial neon lighting from the futuristic city, creating a high-contrast, moody yet vibrant atmosphere. Volumetric lighting beams cut through the rain, illuminating the dust and water particles, while soft rim lights outline the edges of the motorcycle and the rider to separate them from the background. Hard reflections are visible on the chrome and wet surfaces, with distinct specular highlights on the raindrops and the motorcycle's body. Post-processing effects include a subtle chromatic aberration on the high-contrast edges, a soft lens flare near the energy core of the bike, and a gentle vignette around the corners to focus attention on the center. The materials are rendered with extreme fidelity, showcasing the interplay between the smooth, wet surfaces of the rain, the brushed metal of the bike, the translucent jade-like plastics, and the soft, fibrous textures of the traditional clothing elements.\n\nThe overall atmosphere of the poster is one of energetic harmony, blending the tranquility of nature with the excitement of the future. It evokes a feeling"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 121, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 83, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "1.3.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 24}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [121], "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [140, 26], "pos": [336.6285095214844, 285.5110168457031], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 120, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 85, "type": "easy cleanGpuUsed", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "1.3.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy cleanGpuUsed"}, "order": 20}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [753.3882123385627, 308.8570996146617], "scale": 1.0610764609500107}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "海报设计", "bounding": [-213.98440551757812, 187.66348266601562, 2508.085693359375, 1057.7899169921875]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "海报内容简单描述", "bounding": [-698.2332763671875, -250.54592895507812, 420, 283.5999450683594]}], "links": [[48, 33, 0, 32, 0, "LLAMACPPMODEL"], [49, 34, 0, 32, 1, "LLAMACPPARAMS"], [103, 32, 0, 24, 1, "STRING"], [109, 81, 0, 32, 5, "STRING"], [110, 82, 0, 32, 6, "STRING"], [112, 91, 0, 86, 0, "LLAMACPPMODEL"], 